    {key="after-83", phase="after", level=83, lines={
        {"wren", "Shortest day of the year. From tomorrow, a little more light every evening."},
        {"noelle", "You make that sound like good news, Mr Wren."},
        {"wren", "It's always good news, miss. Every single year."},
